ito tu ayuda.","ar":"أسأل لأنني أحتاج إلى مساعدتك."},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s27"},"s.s03":{"k":"s","t":"Where do you live?","g":{"en":"Where do you live?","fr":"Où habites-tu ?","es":"¿Dónde vives?","ar":"أين تسكن؟"},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s03"},"s.s20":{"k":"s","t":"Yes, a little. This language is not easy.","g":{"en":"Yes, a little. This language is not easy.","fr":"Oui, un peu. Cette langue n'est pas facile.","es":"Sí, un poco. Este idioma no es fácil.","ar":"نعم، قليلا. هذه اللغة ليست سهلة."},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s20"},"s.s11":{"k":"s","t":"What is your phone number?","g":{"en":"What is your phone number?","fr":"Quel est ton numéro de téléphone ?","es":"¿Cuál es tu número de teléfono?","ar":"ما رقم هاتفك؟"},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s11"},"s.s26":{"k":"s","t":"Who can answer this question?","g":{"en":"Who can answer this question?","fr":"Qui peut répondre à cette question ?","es":"¿Quién puede responder a esta pregunta?","ar":"من يستطيع أن يجيب عن هذا السؤال؟"},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s26"},"s.s07":{"k":"s","t":"How are you today?","g":{"en":"How are you today?","fr":"Comment vas-tu aujourd'hui ?","es":"¿Cómo estás hoy?","ar":"كيف حالك اليوم؟"},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s07"},"s.s05":{"k":"s","t":"Why are you late?","g":{"en":"Why are you late?","fr":"Pourquoi es-tu en retard ?","es":"¿Por qué llegas tarde?","ar":"لماذا أنت متأخر؟"},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s05"},"s.s18":{"k":"s","t":"Please speak slowly.","g":{"en":"Please speak slowly.","fr":"Parlez lentement, s'il vous plaît.","es":"Hable despacio, por favor.","ar":"تكلم ببطء من فضلك."},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s18"},"s.s08":{"k":"s","t":"How many brothers do you have?","g":{"en":"How many brothers do you have?","fr":"Combien de frères as-tu ?","es":"¿Cuántos hermanos tienes?","ar":"كم أخا لديك؟"},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s08"},"s.s19":{"k":"s","t":"Do you speak English?","g":{"en":"Do you speak English?","fr":"Parlez-vous anglais ?","es":"¿Habla inglés?","ar":"هل تتكلم الإنجليزية؟"},"a":"en/b3-u04/s-s19"},"s.s17":{"k":"s","t":"Can you repeat that, please?","g":{"en":"Can 